<% content_for :title, t("helpers.title.registration_wizard.start") %>

<div class="govuk-grid-row">
  <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
    <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">
      <span class="govuk-heading-l">National professional development (NPD) courses</span>
      Check funding eligibility and register for Teaching in reception course
    </h1>

    <p>Use this service to:</p>

    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>check eligibility for DfE funding, or tell us how you will self-fund</li>
      <li>register with DfE for this course</li>
      <li><%= govuk_link_to "log in", user_teacher_auth_omniauth_authorize_path %> to see the status of your registration</li>
      <li><%= govuk_link_to "change your training provider", user_teacher_auth_omniauth_authorize_path %> if you are already registered</li>
      <li><%= govuk_link_to "get your certificate", user_teacher_auth_omniauth_authorize_path %> when you have completed the course</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">How to register</h2>

    <p>To register, you first need to choose a training provider. All providers have been selected by the DfE.</p>

    <h3 class="govuk-heading-m">1. Choose a training provider</h3>

    <p>All providers deliver the same <%= external_link_to "course content", :learn_about_ttes %>, however there may be differences in how they choose to deliver the course. You can visit their website to learn more.</p>

    <%= govuk_warning_text(text: "You must register with DfE before you apply with a provider.") %>

    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <% providers = course_cohort ? course_cohort.lead_providers.alphabetical : LeadProvider.none %>
      <% providers.each do |provider| %>
        <li><%= govuk_link_to provider.name, provider.url %></li>
      <% end %>
    </ul>

    <h3 class="govuk-heading-m">2. Register with DfE</h3>

    <p>When you register with the DfE, we will:</p>

    <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
      <li>check and confirm your eligibility for funding</li>
      <li>notify your chosen training provider</li>
    </ol>

    <p>Your provider will:</p>

    <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
      <li>contact you to complete the application</li>
      <li>confirm if they have a funded place available</li>
    </ol>

    <p>If your training provider is unable to offer a funded place, you can come back and use this service to <%= govuk_link_to "register with a different provider", user_teacher_auth_omniauth_authorize_path %>.</p>

    <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Before you start</h2>

    <p>You'll need a GOV One Login account (you'll be prompted to sign in or create one).</p>

    <p class="govuk-body">
      By continuing, you agree to our <%= govuk_link_to("privacy notice", privacy_policy_path) %>.
    </p>

    <% if Feature.registration_enabled? %>
      <%=
        render(
          'shared/teacher_auth/redirect_button',
          button_text: "Start now"
        )
      %>
    <% end %>

  </div>
</div>
